type: software
title: "asi_regimes: code for Kinsella and Mahadevan (2026), J. Climate"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB code that runs the idealized stochastic model, processes the
  observational and reanalysis data, computes the air-sea interaction (ASI)
  regime parameter P_o, and generates the figures in Kinsella and
  Mahadevan (2026).
